    "reason": "The agent image contains two labeled ChIP-seq panels and marks two peak intervals per panel, but it materially differs from the reference segmentation visualization: the reference shows exact signals and cyan piecewise-constant model segments for both bases-counted data types, whereas the agent uses different scaling/plot structure and colored raw peak traces without the corresponding segmentation-model presentation. This discrepancy cannot be resolved from the declared image pair alone.",
