        "reason": "Both images visualize H3K36me3 and H3K4me3 with genomic position and two highlighted regions, but the reference is a 2×2 faceted plot by experiment and bases.counted with black exact traces and cyan model step segments; the agent image is two stacked experiment plots with light-gray background traces and red/blue peak traces, substantially different signal magnitudes and interval displays.",
